. webdoc put <h2>Diagnostics And Sensitivity</h2>

. webdoc put <p>The verification script exports <code>table_model_diagnostics.c
> sv</code> with a common in-sample <code>R^2</code>, observed RMSE, and true-c
> urve RMSE. In the current run, <code>npregress kernel</code> and NNS OLS are 
> close in the smooth education and water simulations, while NNS OLS improves s
> ubstantially in the clustered peak/dip benchmark.</p>

